# Plugin: Test-Driven Development

Purpose:
  Adapt TDD skill for SDDRA QA chain.

Adaptation:
  Maps RED-GREEN-REFACTOR to QA chain:
    RED -> TS (Test Suite) - write failing test
    GREEN -> BE (Backend) - minimal code to pass
    REFACTOR -> QA (Quality Assurance) - clean up

  Iron Law: NO CODE IN project/ WITHOUT FAILING TEST FIRST

Usage:
  Chain: feature, bugfix, refactor (TS stage)
  Trigger: Task enters TS stage, new feature, bug fix

State: +
